### Criar usuário
POST http://localhost:8080/api/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "admin",
    "email": "teste@fiap.com.br",
    "senha": "123456"
}

### Listar usuários
GET http://localhost:8080/api/usuarios

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "moronirsol@gmail.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}